== Psi-Tech Integration ==
The [[Star Seer]] role is supported by dedicated [[Psi-Tech]] infrastructure:

* '''Observatory''' — [[Star Seer Observatory]] is the canonical Star Seer workplace.
* '''Astrology compute''' — [[Synastry Mesh]] provides reproducible signed natal + transit calculation.
* '''Targeting''' — [[Psi Harmonizer]] uses [[SynastryEngine]] outputs (delivered via Synastry Mesh).
* '''Recording''' — Star Seer sessions are captured by [[Psi Recorder]] (operator-side) and [[Field Recorder]] (environment-side).
* '''Calibration''' — Star Seer sessions of consequence are run in a [[Resonant Chamber]] for documented baseline.
* '''Federation''' — Star Seer outputs reach allies via [[Earth Intelligence Network|EIN]] gossip.

The Star Seer is not the [[Psi-Tech]]; the Psi-Tech is the Star Seer's amplification.

